However the tone of Rio's speech was dramatically different from last year, when he told the U.N. General Assembly that North Korea's missile targets on U.S. Terrestrial Terrestrial Terrestrations was inevitable after "Evil President" Trump called Kim a "missile man" on a suicide mission.
